# Conformance harness working directory. `pnpm conformance` fetches the C-CDA R2.1
# Schematron, its voc.xml, the CDA R2 XML schema and the public sample corpus into here at
# run time and never commits any of them. This entry is load-bearing twice over: the
# Schematron and voc.xml are forbidden in this repository by the harness's own acceptance
# criterion, and a third-party clinical document that reached a commit would be in git
# history forever. `scripts/phi-scan.ts` walks the whole working tree and decides scope by
# content rather than by path, so a gitignored directory is the only place a fetched corpus
# document can sit without reddening a blocking gate.
.conformance-artifacts/

# Local
.cache/
.turbo/
dist-artifacts/
